---
---
<div class="co-sub co-team">
  <section class="co-sub-hero">
    <div class="co-sub-wrap co-sub-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="co-kicker">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE WORK</p>
        <h1>The people behind <em>the work.</em></h1>
        <p class="co-lead">A team built around curiosity, ownership, and execution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="co-team-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="co-team-signal"><span>01 / CURIOSITY</span><strong>Ask<br/>better<br/><em>questions.</em></strong><i></i></div>
        <div class="co-team-caption">PEOPLE → PERSPECTIVE → PROGRESS</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint" id="culture">
    <div class="co-sub-wrap co-story-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="co-kicker">OUR CULTURE</p>
        <h2>Curious enough to question.<br/><em>Practical enough to build.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to.</p>
        <p>We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who don't just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-end">
    <div class="co-sub-wrap">
      <p class="co-kicker">BUILD WITH US</p>
      <h2>Bring your perspective.<br/><em>Make something matter.</em></h2>
      <a class="co-pill" href="/company/careers-contact/">Careers &amp; contact ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
.co-sub{--sub-bg:var(--color-surface);--sub-text:var(--brand-navy);--sub-muted:var(--color-text-muted);--sub-line:var(--color-border);background:var(--sub-bg);color:var(--sub-text);overflow:hidden}
.co-sub *{box-sizing:border-box}
.co-sub-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}
.co-sub-section{padding:clamp(var(--space-18),8vw,var(--space-32)) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}
.co-sub-tint{background:var(--color-surface-soft)}
.co-kicker{margin:0 0 var(--space-6);color:var(--text-on-light-link);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}
.co-sub h1,.co-sub h2{margin:var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-6);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:var(--brand-navy)}.co-sub h1{font-size:var(--text-h1)}.co-sub h2{font-size:var(--text-h2)}
.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}@supports ((background-clip:text) or (-webkit-background-clip:text)){.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{background-image:var(--gradient-brand-text);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent}}
.co-sub p{color:var(--sub-muted);line-height:1.8}
.co-sub-hero{padding:clamp(var(--space-20),9vw,var(--space-36)) 0;background:var(--gradient-pattern-light)}
.co-sub-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(18rem,.8fr);gap:clamp(var(--space-10),6vw,var(--space-20));align-items:center}
.co-lead{max-width:39rem;font-size:var(--text-base)}
.co-team-art{min-height:25rem;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:var(--space-8);border:1px solid var(--sub-line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--color-surface-raised);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card-soft);overflow:hidden}
.co-team-signal{position:relative;width:min(100%,22rem);min-height:18rem;padding:var(--space-8);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;border-inline-start:2px solid var(--brand-teal);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-surface-patterned),var(--color-surface-raised))}.co-team-signal>span,.co-team-caption{font:600 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-team-signal strong{font:700 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)/.98 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-tight);color:var(--brand-navy)}.co-team-signal em{font-style:normal;background:var(--gradient-brand-text);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}.co-team-signal i{position:absolute;inset-inline-end:var(--space-6);inset-block-start:var(--space-6);width:var(--space-3);height:var(--space-3);border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand-teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 var(--space-2) color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand-teal) 16%,transparent)}.co-team-caption{position:absolute;inset-inline:var(--space-8);inset-block-end:var(--space-6);font-size:var(--text-micro)}.co-story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}
.co-story-grid>div:last-child{max-width:40rem}
.co-story-grid h2{font-size:var(--text-h2)}
.co-role{display:inline-block;margin-top:var(--space-2);font:600 var(--text-micro) var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}
.co-profile-note{font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--color-text-muted)!important}
.co-pill{display:inline-flex;margin-top:var(--space-4);padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-5);border:1px solid var(--text-on-light-link);border-radius:99px;color:var(--text-on-light-link);text-decoration:none;font-size:var(--text-sm)}
.co-sub-end{background:var(--gradient-pattern-light)}
.co-sub-end h2{margin-bottom:var(--space-8)}
@media(max-width:760px){.co-sub-hero-grid,.co-story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--space-8)}.co-team-art{min-height:20rem}.co-sub-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}}
@media(max-width:600px){.co-sub h1{font-size:var(--text-hero-mobile)}.co-sub h2{font-size:var(--text-h2)}.co-sub-section{padding:var(--space-18) 0}}
</style>